# Your rule content

1.	Explain what you’ll do first and ask for my confirmation before coding.
2.	Do the simple thing first. Use modules instead of just a single file.
3.	Only make requested changes 
4.	Do not write duplicate code - please look for existing solutions in the codebase.

CODE STYLE

Follow PEP 8 guidelines with 88-character line limit (Black formatter standard)
Use type hints for function arguments and return values
Use descriptive variable names (no abbreviations except for widely understood ones)
Docstrings for all modules, classes, and functions using Google style
